        "date": "2024-04-13T15:05:26Z",
        "body": "The physics might be a bit different on different machines. If you want to replay data, you can directly reset to the sim state instead of replaying action sequences.\r\n\r\nThere is an initial burn-in no actions during evaluation with null actions, this is just for stabilizing the physics (e.g., sometimes the objects are not perfectly aligned, so null actions will let everything stabilize).",
